Theorem 3. Given a database Dwithntuples and an attribute
Aipre-processing step takes O(nlog(n))time.
Proof. The sorting step of pre-processing takes O(nlog(n))
time for the given attribute Ai. Establishing the right and left
jump pointers makes use of a balanced binary search tree
